WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.910
Mandy was very upset.

2
00:00:09.911 --> 00:00:16.988
Rishi was explaining the caste system, but she didn't think it was right.

3
00:00:16.989 --> 00:00:21.008
"It's cruel!" she said angrily.

4
00:00:21.009 --> 00:00:24.810
"You treat cows better than humans."

5
00:00:24.811 --> 00:00:30.806
"The untouchables did something wrong in a past life," explained Rishi.

6
00:00:30.807 --> 00:00:33.705
"The gods are punishing them."

7
00:00:33.706 --> 00:00:39.101
"But you don't even look at them," said Mandy.

8
00:00:39.102 --> 00:00:42.556
Vinnie poked Mandy to keep quiet.

9
00:00:42.557 --> 00:00:48.861
"If we look at them, we will be unclean for the whole day," said Rishi.

10
00:00:48.862 --> 00:00:52.796
"Well, I think—," Mandy began.

11
00:00:52.797 --> 00:00:57.576
Vinnie interrupted: "I think we're at the palace."

12
00:00:57.577 --> 00:01:02.274
They looked ahead and saw a spectacular view.

13
00:01:02.275 --> 00:01:06.513
Flowers decorated the road to the palace entrance.

14
00:01:06.514 --> 00:01:11.791
The children passed through an arch with fountains on either side.

15
00:01:11.792 --> 00:01:18.880
"It's wonderful!" Mandy gasped, forgetting her anger.

16
00:01:18.881 --> 00:01:25.178
"Look at the elephants and monkeys!" Vinnie laughed.

17
00:01:25.179 --> 00:01:29.353
Trainers were putting gold paint on two elephants.

18
00:01:29.354 --> 00:01:33.329
Monkeys sat in the trees above, watching.

19
00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:38.194
Golden statues stood along the way to the palace door.

20
00:01:38.195 --> 00:01:41.578
A male servant led them inside.

21
00:01:41.579 --> 00:01:47.077
"The palace has over a hundred rooms," whispered Rishi.

22
00:01:47.078 --> 00:01:49.408
"This one is for chess."

23
00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:52.297
He pointed to an open door.

24
00:01:52.298 --> 00:01:54.793
"There are many bedrooms.

25
00:01:54.794 --> 00:01:58.670
The king can sleep in a different bed every night."

26
00:01:58.671 --> 00:02:01.640
They waited behind two women.

27
00:02:01.641 --> 00:02:05.636
One woman held a live chicken in her arm.

28
00:02:05.637 --> 00:02:09.256
She was yelling at a woman holding a baby.

29
00:02:09.257 --> 00:02:13.474
"There you are!" a familiar voice said sharply.

30
00:02:13.475 --> 00:02:17.355
It was Babu Yadav waiting by a doorway.

31
00:02:17.356 --> 00:02:22.864
Music floated out of the room as the women ahead of them went in.

32
00:02:22.865 --> 00:02:25.691
"Babu Yadav, have pity.

33
00:02:25.692 --> 00:02:30.175
These children are strangers," began Rishi's father.

34
00:02:30.176 --> 00:02:32.521
"They did not know . . ."

35
00:02:32.522 --> 00:02:35.811
"I don't care," said Babu Yadav.

36
00:02:35.812 --> 00:02:38.703
"He must be punished."

37
00:02:38.704 --> 00:02:42.631
The women quickly came out through the door.

38
00:02:42.632 --> 00:02:44.114
"It's our turn.

39
00:02:44.115 --> 00:02:45.492
The king is waiting!"

40
00:02:45.493 --> 00:02:49.981
exclaimed Babu Yadav, as he walked into the king's hall.

41
00:02:49.982 --> 00:02:53.803
Rishi's father and the children followed.

42
00:02:53.804 --> 00:02:59.369
"Whoa!" gasped Vinnie when he stepped inside.

43
00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:04.068
A tiger tied to a post was licking a huge bone.

44
00:03:04.069 --> 00:03:08.655
A small distance away, musicians were playing.

45
00:03:08.656 --> 00:03:12.007
One plucked a harp.

46
00:03:12.008 --> 00:03:17.987
Two women stood beside a short, fat, man sitting on a soft couch.

47
00:03:17.988 --> 00:03:23.291
They gently waved fans made of animal hair over his head.

48
00:03:23.292 --> 00:03:27.453
The man wore a long robe and tight pants.

49
00:03:27.454 --> 00:03:32.139
The turban on his head was decorated with jewels.

50
00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:36.220
"What is your problem?" the man asked.

51
00:03:36.221 --> 00:03:39.563
"My king, I come before you with a troubled heart,"

52
00:03:39.564 --> 00:03:43.346
Babu Yadav began, bowing low.

53
00:03:43.347 --> 00:03:48.055
The king nodded for Babu Yadav to continue.

54
00:03:48.056 --> 00:03:54.341
The man told about the cow and Vinnie, and the king's eyes opened wide.

55
00:03:54.342 --> 00:03:57.642
He stared at Vinnie and Mandy.

56
00:03:57.643 --> 00:04:01.842
"You are not from India," he pointed out.

57
00:04:01.843 --> 00:04:07.134
"No, sir, I mean, your majesty," Vinnie stuttered.

58
00:04:07.135 --> 00:04:12.305
"If I may go on, my king," Babu Yadav interrupted.

59
00:04:12.306 --> 00:04:15.099
The king held up his hand.

60
00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:17.851
"Your cow was not harmed.

61
00:04:17.852 --> 00:04:25.053
So we can overlook this matter," yawned the king.

62
00:04:25.054 --> 00:04:32.546
He clapped his hands. "Next!"
